#2b2d42", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 317066899, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 333290291, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Code first, infrastructure second: the shared module compiles on its own\nOne service first (auth), then copy to all: a mistake is fixed once, not nine times\nCustom metrics come after generic metrics (small additions on a working base)\nPrometheus before Grafana: no UP targets = empty dashboards\nE2E last: it tests the whole chain, including a deliberate failure", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Code first, infrastructure second: the shared module compiles on its own\nOne service first (auth), then copy to all: a mistake is fixed once, not nine times\nCustom metrics come after generic metrics (small additions on a working base)\nPrometheus before Grafana: no UP targets = empty dashboards\nE2E last: it tests the whole chain, including a deliberate failure", "lineHeight": 1.3, "autoResize": true, "baseline": 17}, {"id": "e0486", "type": "rectangle", "x": 44, "y": 6295, "width": 2520, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#e9e5de", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 60, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1704429292, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1769883857, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0487", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 6290, "width": 2520, "height": 60, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#3d405b", "backgroundColor": "#3d405b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId":